    <string name="privacy_title">How Awake Steps uses your data</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Awake Steps reads your steps, calories burned, distance and sleep sessions from Health Connect. Sleep is used only to work out when your day starts (when you wake up) and ends (when you go to sleep); steps, calories and distance are added up between those times.\n\nEverything is processed on your phone. Nothing is uploaded, shared, or sent anywhere, and the app never writes to Health Connect.\n\nYou can revoke access at any time in Health Connect settings.</string>
